    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2017_phy_q25.png\">\r\n\r\nIn the given circuit, the binary inputs at $A$ and $B$ are both 1 in one case and both 0 in the next case. The respective outputs at $Y$ in these two cases will be",
