  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2017_phy_a25.png\">\r\n\r\nThe output of logic gate circuit\r\nfor\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\nY=\\frac{}{A \\cdot B+\\bar{A} \\bar{B}} \\\\\r\nA=1\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\r\n$$\r\nB=1 \\Rightarrow Y=0\r\n$$\r\nand for $\\quad A=0, B=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad Y=0$",
